{"id":"2e10c73c7c9608d7","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-LR-positive-closed.md","title":"LR归约的正测有效闭子类刻画","display":"thm-LR-positive-closed — LR归约的正测有效闭子类刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-LR-positive-closed","aliases":["43-thm-LR-positive-closed"],"display":"thm-LR-positive-closed — LR归约的正测有效闭子类刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-lr-red]]","[[43-df-pi01class]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Theorem 15.1.40; printed p.429 / PDF p.449","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-LR-positive-closed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-LR-positive-closed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-LR-positive-closed — LR归约的正测有效闭子类刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c03c10d191232ac0\" href=\"?note=c03c10d191232ac0\" title=\"43-df-lr-red\">43-df-lr-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 15.1.40; printed p.429 / PDF p.449"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c03c10d191232ac0\" href=\"?note=c03c10d191232ac0\" title=\"43-df-lr-red\">43-df-lr-red</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}\">\\(\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\">\\(\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}B\\iff\\forall P\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\;\\left(\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}(P)\\land\\mu(P)&gt;0\\Rightarrow\\exists Q\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\;\\bigl(Q\\subseteq P\\land\\Pi^{0,B}_1\\operatorname{Class}(Q)\\land\\mu(Q)&gt;0\\bigr)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}B\\iff\\forall P\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\;\\left(\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}(P)\\land\\mu(P)&gt;0\\Rightarrow\\exists Q\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\;\\bigl(Q\\subseteq P\\land\\Pi^{0,B}_1\\operatorname{Class}(Q)\\land\\mu(Q)&gt;0\\bigr)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>结论要求Q仍有正测度，不要求与P同测度；后者是更强的另一个结果，需要额外A≤TB′前提。A、B均未预先假定低或Δ⁰₂。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 15.1.40; printed p.429 / PDF p.449。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-lr-red","status":"resolved","id":"c03c10d191232ac0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lr-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi01class]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lr-red","status":"resolved","id":"c03c10d191232ac0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}$ 见 [[43-df-lr-red]]；$\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}$ 见 [[43-df-pi01class]]；$\\mu$ 为 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度，满足 $\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}$ 见 [[43-df-lr-red]]；$\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}$ 见 [[43-df-pi01class]]；$\\mu$ 为 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度，满足 $\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}$ 见 [[43-df-lr-red]]；$\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}$ 见 [[43-df-pi01class]]；$\\mu$ 为 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度，满足 $\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_{\\mathrm{LR}}B\\iff\\forall P\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\;\\left(\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}(P)\\land\\mu(P)>0\\Rightarrow\\exists Q\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\;\\bigl(Q\\subseteq P\\land\\Pi^{0,B}_1\\operatorname{Class}(Q)\\land\\mu(Q)>0\\bigr)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1651,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-406","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-LR-positive-closed]] — LR归约的正测有效闭子类刻画"}],"outgoing":["c03c10d191232ac0","cc07cf2b9ec0019e","ab1ef7b1cac112c1"]}